# M02 (Marine 2) replay script: unit selection, minimap, single-marine combat (notes/wave1.md W5b).
# Run with MISSION=M02. polls B+n as in m01.pad. Keep one marine fighting at a time: the lifted DirectSound
# voice pool (about 6 voices) faults when several marines fire at once, which ends the lifted reference run.
B+60 start
B+150 a
# selection variety: d-pad cycle, X/Y jumps, White/Black, double tap, add with LT, grow box with held A
B+260 right
B+290 right
B+320 left
B+350 up
B+380 down
B+410 x
B+440 y
B+470 white
B+500 black
B+540 a
B+552 a
B+600 lt+a:6
B+592 lt:30
B+680 white+right
B+720 black+left
# minimap: right stick moves the minimap cursor, A jumps
B+780 rright:20
B+840 a
B+900 rleft:30
B+960 a
B+1020 rup:20
B+1080 a
B+1140 rdown:25
B+1200 a
# pointer over odd ground, a box select, a command on unreachable ground
B+1260 lleft:30
B+1320 a:40
B+1400 lup:40
B+1460 b
B+1520 ldown:60
B+1580 b
B+1640 a
# single Infantry attack as in m6
B+1700 lleft:17
B+1760 lup:10
B+1820 a
B+1900 lright:115
B+2050 lup:30
B+2150 b
B+3000 lleft:37
B+3080 lup:40
B+3200 b
